        <div class="faq">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q">Is SEO competitive in Denver?</button>
            <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes, Denver is one of the most competitive local SEO markets in Colorado. Rapid growth, a dense field of established businesses and agencies, and high-value commercial keywords all make ranking difficult without a strong, consistent strategy.</p></div>
          </div>
